# 12. Forced freshness escalation

For broad discovery:

```text id="o9afbk"
freshness = cache_ok
```

For a candidate that matters:

```text id="g967u9"
freshness = force_fresh
```

which maps to:

```http id="7n9us6"
no_cache=true
```

SerpApi documents that an exactly matching search can be served from its one-hour cache and cached searches do not count against the monthly searches. `no_cache=true` bypasses that cache, while `no_cache` and `async` cannot be combined. ([SerpApi][6])

Implement:

```ts id="ocr0l7"
function freshnessParams(
  policy: FreshnessPolicy
) {
  switch (policy) {
    case "cache_ok":
      return {};

    case "force_fresh":
      return { no_cache: true };

    case "replay":
      throw new Error(
        "Replay must not call SerpApi"
      );
  }
}
```

